# ALLOWLIST: everything is ignored by default. Only the files listed below can be committed.
# To add a new file you must un-ignore it here on purpose (and it must pass the leak checks).
# Client data, logs, backups, contract wording, .env.local etc. can never be added by accident.
*
!*/

